The public half of the key storm releases are signed with — the
same release key as EveSynapse (its public half also lives in that
repo's internal/releasesig/trusted_keys.pem). The private half is
the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY Actions secret; the release workflow
refuses to sign with a key whose public half is not listed here.
Only public keys belong in this file.

